@@ -4,6 +4,11 @@
 This library adheres to `Semantic Versioning 2.0 <http://semver.org/>`_.
 
 **UNRELEASED**
+
+- Fixed ``SpooledTemporaryFile`` rollover to preserve data and seek positions,
+  permit retry after allocation errors, and use the entire encoded buffer's
+  byte size for automatic rollover. A zero limit disables automatic rollover;
+  text encodings and newline translation are preserved when moving to disk.
 
 - Added the ability to specify the thread name in ``start_blocking_portal()``
   (`#818 <https://github.com/agronholm/anyio/issues/818>`_; PR by @davidbrochart)
